":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2862160-1838407329258316","game_id":"steam-2862160","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Deck compatibility","summary":"We love the Steam Deck and SteamOS and regularly test the Steam Deck together with high-end PC's. We'll have 3 or more players, using both SteamOS and Windows, seamlessly running dungeons together and having a great time!Tribal Towers : Siege of the Shifting Fortress dynamically switches between controller or keyboard/mouse at just a touch of the controlsFrom handheld to big-screen TV we hope you'll enjoy it as much as we do!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-17T02:28:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329258316","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2862160-1832065502816548","game_id":"steam-2862160","kind":"announcement","title":"New Characters Available","summary":"Something we've wanted to do for a long time has landed at last. Play your favorite style by picking from an array of base characters. How about a hammer wielding Paladin with the ability to heal? Or a staff wielding Wizard with offensive spells and Mana Refund? A classic warrior with a Sword and Shield, and Shield Barrier? There are more, a priest, summoner, berserker, ranger, spearman, and punch and kick throwing monk! It's a lot of fun, and a brand new skill chooser will give you access to it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-09T00:07:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502816548","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2862160-1811138915567254","game_id":"steam-2862160","kind":"announcement","title":"Still working hard!","summary":"Just letting everyone know we are hard at work on this game! There is so much good stuff we're excited to share, but also a number of details to finish polishing. Here are some details - Active Abilities - such as brand new Ice abilities like Blizzard, and many more that we'll save for a demo.Passive Abilities - like Mana Refund, and Shield Barrier have been implemented and are working great!Brand new artwork and levels.A new way of entering each type of themed dungeons.Multiplayer improvements!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-23T21:51:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811138915567254","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2862160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:20:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:20:28Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2862160":"2026-10-26T00:20:28Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2862160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:20:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:20:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4681750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:20:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:20:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
